'''Smoke puff''' is a raw balanced [[Ashlands]]-tier food which is used in various recipes.

== Availability ==
Smoke puffs can be found scattered throughout the [[Ashlands]] [[Biomes|biome]], including on or around rocks or [[Ashlands ruins]]. They respawn every 4 hours.

